sequenceDiagram
    participant C as AI Client
    participant MCP as mcp_server.py
    participant T as Tool Function
    participant AH as auth_helpers.py
    participant SM as SessionManager
    participant HC as http_client.py
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant HM as HandleManager

    C->>MCP: Call tool with parameters
    MCP->>T: Dispatch to registered tool
    T->>AH: require_auth(session_manager)
    AH->>SM: get_current_session()
    SM-->>AH: SessionInfo or None
    alt not authenticated
        AH-->>T: "Please login first" string
        T-->>C: Error message
    end
    AH->>SM: get_valid_id_token()
    SM-->>AH: id_token (refreshed if needed)
    AH-->>T: (session, user_id, id_token)
    T->>T: Build request body (Pydantic model)
    T->>HC: post_to_backend(endpoint, body, id_token)
    HC->>BE: POST with Bearer token
    BE-->>HC: JSON response
    HC-->>T: response["data"]
    T->>HM: store_data(data_type, location, data)
    HM-->>T: handle string
    T-->>C: Summary + handle